# OFM Mosquitto access control (Architecture Overview §13).
# Every PUBLISH and SUBSCRIBE is checked against these rules. A user that is
# not listed here can do nothing. 'deny' rules are checked before any grant.

# Runtime (Node-RED): publishes telemetry, metadata and platform topics.
# It may not use the write-back branch, which gets its own credential when
# write-back is built.
user ofm_runtime
topic deny ofm/_cmd/#
topic readwrite #

# Consumers (Grafana, Python, debug clients): subscribe only.
user ofm_reader
topic read #
topic read $SYS/#
